Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the love of - Josuke, are\Nyou still playing that game?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't turn it off right\Nthis second, I'm gonna scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five more minutes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just five more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mom, just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to get to the best part!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quitting guarantees I'll\Nlive the pathetic life of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a scrub who doesn't follow\Nthrough on his promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The longer you play your little game, the\Nharder these kicks are gonna get! I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long do you think you can hold out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it away and start your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and would it kill you\Nto take off your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is nighttime, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't see you anymore. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why, Sachiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the flames of our love burned down?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that I turned it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:00:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on, shut off, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem Jotaro Kujo\Nhas refused to leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after I went out of my way\Nto give him an explicit warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be a reason, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Chili Pepper?
