Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.17,0:02:40.80,Title Part 4,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(142,885)\fs60}Episode 11: {\fs80} Red Hot Chili Pepper, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.17,0:02:40.80,Title Part 4,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(142,885)\fs60}Episode 11: {\fs80} Red Hot Chili Pepper Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the brightest bulb, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly it escaped your\Nnotice that I've been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,popping in and out of\Nhere for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This asshole's been keeping\Ntabs on me the entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of my other hot spots is\Nthe house belonging to Okuyasu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the brother of that fool I knocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm also well aware of that schoolgirl\NYukako Yamagishi and Koichi Hiroze's reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know Toshikazu Hazamada and\NTamami Kobayashi are in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about this isn't making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From everything I've seen, you're\Na conniving, bird-brained coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What reason could you possibly\Nhave for turning up at my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready to take me on fair and square?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you're not moronic\Nenough to believe that anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could do would actually\Nbe enough to mess me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me? Mess you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing so foul for this birdie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death will be a humane one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, so you're a coward and a\Ncomedian with a crappy sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're two for two, birdbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full disclosure before we begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already told Jotaro his Star\NPlatinum poses a great threat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His vigilance is annoyingly steadfast,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his stand's time-stopping\Nability is formidable. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only course of action left\Nto me is to completely decimate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that interloper in a head-to-head\Nbattle for supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I fight, Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to test my abilities\Nagainst you, Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come a little bit closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm asking you to\Ndo is unleash an attack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as swift and precise as\None of star platinums.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you're all the way back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried your punches\Nwon't be quite up to snuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that mockery I'm\Ndetecting in your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have every confidence in the\Ncapabilities of you and your stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why don't you come closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to give me your best\Nshot, so put your back into it, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay one on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to get nice and close.
