Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So fast! I'll in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your incessant squawking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's faster than I ever imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep it up, I'll just\Nhave to de-beak you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by the way, Jotaro's Star\NPlatinum's got nothing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever forget that. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arrogance got the best of me,\Nand I underestimated his abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, what the hell is\Ngoing on in there? That blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was like being on the receiving end\Nof a supercharged jet engine blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might actually be stronger than Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very impressive, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting your shining\Ndiamond to be so robust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear that I'm not the\Nonly one of us who's matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly my time hasn't yet arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until Chili Pepper is stronger, vanquishing\NJotaro shall remain a far-off fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he needs is a source of electricity\Nto pop out and pulverize us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's worse is he can\Ncontrol his stand from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, why did it sound like\N50 tornadoes flew through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got bit by another bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's days like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I was one of\Nthose fancy bug zappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Josuke! Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this all about, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why'd you want to meet us all\Nthe way out here in the boondocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't Tony-O's or that cafe have been\Na much better place to sit down and talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't the one who\Ncalled you guys out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was actually Jotaro. Mr. Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder what he wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's about chili pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you say chili pepper, you don't mean\Nthat horrible Stan Chili Pepper, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he paid me a\Nvisit at home last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me\Nas soon as it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He turns into a completely\Ndifferent person anytime
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he hears even the slightest\Nmention of chili pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can you blame him when he\Nlost his brother to that stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told Josuke not to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discussing this downtown wasn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be surrounded by electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to risk being\Nspied on, so I had us meet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, just so you know, Chili Pepper\Ngrates the ever-loving shit out of me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That slithery bastard thinks he can\Ndo whatever he damn well pleases.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spies on people, eavesdrops,\Nswipes anything he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that's why I woke up to my homework\Nbeing gone from my desk the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes total sense to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I thought my mom threw it\Naway when she took out the trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think now's the\Ntime to worry about that, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, this is the bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason Chili Pepper hasn't raised\Neven more hell is because we're around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't let that fool you, he's\Na lot stronger than he lets on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:08:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can drag anyone he wants into the phone\Nlines as easy as making a prank call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt he has the bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, we need to focus\Non who he's shot with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know firsthand how much\Nstronger he's gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find Chili Pepper's\Nuser as soon as humanly possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.44,0:08:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're here to\Nfigure it out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Mr. Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we found someone to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the three of you will\Nbe pleased to know our guest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of honor is arriving at the\NPort of Morioh at noon today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is this someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, is he a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of his stand is Hermit Purple,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's gotten way too old to\Nrisk going out into the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting as a whole is\Nout of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how old is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you have met\Nhim before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know him quite well, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be pretty\Nstudly back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't know it looking at him\Nnow he's 80 no make that 79 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,79 the guy's practically a\Nfossil his legs definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't what they used\Nto be so he uses a cane
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and two years ago he had\Ngallstones removed not
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to mention his cataracts\Nall his teeth are fake now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he grumbles about\Nmissing his t-bone stakes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh and he's going senile\Nto give it a rest next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're gonna tell me he\Nlikes to talk to mailboxes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on you have gotta be\Nyanking our chains the real
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reason i had you guys\Ncome here was so that you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could protect the old man\Nif chili pepper gets wind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of his arrival you can\Nbet he'll stop at nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to take him down the thing\Nhe dreads most is one of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us discovering the true\Nidentity of his user but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that doesn't explain how\Nthe old timer is gonna help
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us i was against it too\Nbut as soon as he heard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the bow and arrow he\Nheaded to japan despite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this person isn't\NJapanese, Mr. Jotaro? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:10:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, this is life-changing! Huh? What\Nis? What do you mean? Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a 79-year-old Stan\Nuser who isn't from Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I needed to hear!\NWatch out! It's Chili Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he find his way out here?
