Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.80,0:11:03.85,SFXRed,4,0,0,0,,{=3}{\bord0\blur0.8\pos(964.51,15.589)\fade(255,0,255,-750,-749,89,90)\c&H060073&\4a&HFF&}Rumble
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.85,0:11:03.89,SFXRed,4,0,0,0,,{=3}{\blur0.8\pos(964.51,15.589)\fade(255,0,255,-800,-799,39,40)\c&H020102&}Rumble
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.85,0:11:03.89,SFXRed,4,0,0,0,,{=3}{\bord0\blur0.8\pos(964.51,15.589)\fade(255,0,255,-800,-799,39,40)\c&H060073&\4a&HFF&}Rumble
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the speed he's going,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,actually Pepper will get to the old\Nman before we can get him to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your stand to chuck a rock or\Nsomething at that bike and take it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That piece of shit is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush that murdering jailbird\Ninto dust if it's the last thing I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut through space itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Keijo's little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have unfinished business!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, boy! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleporting yourself to the motorcycle\Nwas exceptional, to say the least!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you wasted your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That adorable scratching\Nmotion you do with a hand is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hardly a match for Chili\NPepper's extraordinary speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so as usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your efforts\Nhave been all for naught!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face backs, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:11:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take another look, dickhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I said I'd make something\Ndisappear, I'm at the motorcycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He destroyed the front wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say you\Nwon't be escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's using your head,\NOkuyasu. Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili Pepper won't be able to move very\Nfar away from the motorcycle battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nearest power line is\Nat least 100 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got you cornered\Nlike a rat in a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay focused, he isn't captured yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget he can still\Nuse the bike's battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll do whatever it takes to\Nkill Okuyasu and fly the coop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Color me surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd go to all\Nthis trouble to avenge Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew who my bro was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.46,0:13:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other shoe was gonna drop eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, someone was bound to\Nsnuff him out over something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the thing about crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how far you try to run from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it always has a way of\Ncatching up to you in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's painfully clear,\Neven to a sap like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now for the business at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me who your user\Nis and where he lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do that and I'll spare your life,\Nwhich is more than you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I tell you, you'll spare me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly composed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was positive your bowels would be\Nburning with vengeful fury by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm secretly hoping you\Nwon't give me the info on your user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mentioned to scrape you away,\Nyou glow-in-the-dark shithead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So give me a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the real you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking you can kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that sluggish right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I should laugh or yawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but either way you won't be\Nputting out my lights today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll end you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll make sure you realize\Nhow pathetic your stand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is when compared to the\Nmarvel that is Chili Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you finally understand how slow\Nyou are? Okuyasu! Okuyasu! Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stick around much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he get behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about me being slow,\Nand I may have missed the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I swiped away space, which\Ngives me the ability to teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You big-nosed freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be wrong, but it seems\Nlike you're not as fast as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think someone as slow as\Nyou can slip by my next attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili Pepper's electric charge is fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting weaker and\Nweaker by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand must be running out of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, leave him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll handle him once we get over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already won.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our primary focus needs to be getting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him to tell us where\Nthe bow and arrow are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My energy is fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand may be as slow as molasses,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the ferocity of his attack\Nis downright bone-chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being said, don't you want to finish\Noff your brother's killer for good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try using your head for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be certain I'm not\Nsimply pretending to be frail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's to say I'm not luring Jotaro in\Nclose so I can cleave off his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit spouting bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you do away with me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or wait for me to get the drop on Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were really up to something\Nshady, why would you tell me your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had he just kept his beak shut, he\Ncould have easily played us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would have been in the perfect\Nposition to take me and Jotaro out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since he basically told me\Nnothing's wrong with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the chances of him attacking\Nme are practically zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say you\Nwant me to kill you after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you come to your own conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he on his last legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is he lying through his\Nbeak waiting to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna do it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this asshole isn't really injured,\NI have to kill him right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But is that the right move?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have something up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, I better get over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this\Nnightmare once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about\Ntrying to stop me, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed my bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he has to\Npay the ultimate price!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only truth\Nthat matters right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my heart has shown\Nme what I need to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now eat, shit, and die,\Nyou glorified nightlight!
