Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding the bow and arrow is going\Nto be a real pain in the ass now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he settled\Nthings with that freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gut's telling me Chili\NPepper is still a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underground electrical cables?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He faked all that so I'd expose them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really was fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That motorcycle battery\Nonly holds 12 volts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few moments longer and I\Nwould have been done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must thank you for reviving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor simple-minded Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you'd been a good boy and\Ncontrolled yourself as Totoro instructed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have faded away with the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the location of every electrical\Nline running through this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My original plan was to\Nescape into those cables,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they were too far\Naway from the motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:19:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the state I was in, digging\Nthem up was out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this much electricity at my disposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have more than enough\Npower to challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your lackluster right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
