Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to remember your\Nbrother Keicho saying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something about you never\Nfailing to hold him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how right he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul is underdeveloped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revenge was never going to be within\Nyour reach, you cocksure ignoramus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, Jotaro and Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.76,0:19:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not before I find that\Nold coot Joseph Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And see to it that he\Nshares the same fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as the lamentable Nijimura brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the victor go the spoils!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pulled him into the cables!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu! Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think we were that close\Nand he still got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stand was absolutely terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you even begin to fight\Na remote stand with boundless
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power to tap into every\Nelectrical company within reach?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you guys talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was murdered in cold blood and you're\Nrambling about how strong the enemy was?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should check up on Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one consolation in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have had a guardian\Nangel looking out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird as it sounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his right arm getting chopped off was\Nthe best thing that could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry,\Nso dry those tears, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I fix his arm, his\Nbody will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we lost you for good, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was totally outclassed by that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about revenge, and\Nwe can't focus on setbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the priority here. He needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's how we're gonna beat\NChili Pepper and get true justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to do this for our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that isn't enough, then do it\Nfor all the people you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be stating the\Nobvious, but this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I was taking this too lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have to reach the old\Nman's boat before Chili Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so nonchalant\Nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Okuyasu, he's\Nstill in shock over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can get to the port\Nfaster this way. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you guys wait for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way around it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mario, in order to beat Chili\NPepper, I have to surpass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, we'll be arriving at\Nthe Port of Mario any moment now.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
